==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*slušati}}, from an earlier {{m|sla-pro||*sluxěti}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*ḱlew-}}, whence {{cog|en|listen}} and {{cog|sa|श्रोषति||to listen, obey}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|слу́шать}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-слушать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|слу́шать|impf|pf=послу́шать}}

# {{lb|ru|transitive}} to [[listen]], to [[listen]] to (someone/something)
